#* {{quote-book|en|year=2007|author=Azie Faison; Agyei Tyehimba|title=Game Over: The Rise and Transformation of a Harlem Hustler|publisher=Simon and Schuster|page=69|text=It's impossible to '''floss''' wealth without attracting envy.}}
