===Etymology 2===
From dialectal {{m|en|flosh|t=a flush, stream of water, sluice}}, from {{inh|en|enm|flosche}}, {{m|enm|flusche}}, {{m|enm|flasche}}, {{m|enm|flaske|t=a watery or marshy place, swamp}}, perhaps from {{der|en|fro|flache}}, from {{der|en|dum|vlacke|t=a flat area, plain}}, ultimately related to {{der|en|gmw-pro|*fleutan}}. Compare also {{cog|de|Floss||a float}}.

